{"metadata":{"navigatorTitle":[{"text":"registerForPushNotificationsWithCompletion:","kind":"identifier"}],"title":"registerForPushNotificationsWithCompletion:","fragments":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"registerForPushNotificationsWithCompletion:"}],"role":"symbol","modules":[{"name":"PushwooshCore"}],"externalID":"c:objc(pl)PWConfiguration(cm)registerForPushNotificationsWithCompletion:","symbolKind":"method","roleHeading":"Type Method"},"sections":[],"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/registerForPushNotificationsWithCompletion:","interfaceLanguage":"occ"},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/registerforpushnotificationswithcompletion:"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"occ"}]}],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore","doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"]]},"abstract":[{"text":"Registers the device for push notifications with a completion handler.","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"declarations","declarations":[{"languages":["occ"],"tokens":[{"kind":"text","text":"+ ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:v","text":"void"},{"text":") ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"identifier","text":"registerForPushNotificationsWithCompletion:"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"text":"void (^)(NSString *, NSError *)","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"c:BFv(#*$objc(cs)NSString#*$objc(cs)NSError)"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"text":"completion","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":";","kind":"text"}],"platforms":["iOS"]}]},{"parameters":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Block called when registration completes, providing the push token or an error.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"Token is nil if registration failed or user denied permission.","type":"text"}]}],"name":"completion"}],"kind":"parameters"},{"content":[{"text":"Discussion","level":2,"type":"heading","anchor":"discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"text":"This method combines system permission request with Pushwoosh server registration.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"The completion handler provides feedback on both operations, allowing you to:","type":"text"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Update UI based on registration status"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Track registration analytics"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Handle errors gracefully with retry logic","type":"text"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Sync push token with your backend server"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"anchor":"Example","type":"heading","text":"Example","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Handle registration in onboarding flow with analytics tracking:"}]},{"code":["class OnboardingViewController: UIViewController {","","    func enableNotificationsTapped() {","        showLoadingState()","","        Pushwoosh.configure.registerForPushNotifications { [weak self] token, error in","            DispatchQueue.main.async {","                self?.hideLoadingState()","","                if let error = error {","                    Analytics.track(\"push_registration_failed\", properties: [","                        \"error\": error.localizedDescription","                    ])","                    self?.showRetryOption()","                    return","                }","","                if let token = token {","                    Analytics.track(\"push_registration_success\")","                    self?.syncTokenWithBackend(token)","                    self?.proceedToNextStep()","                } else {","                    Analytics.track(\"push_permission_denied\")","                    self?.showPermissionDeniedInfo()","                }","            }","        }","    }","","    private func syncTokenWithBackend(_ token: String) {","        APIClient.shared.updatePushToken(token) { result in","            if case .failure(let error) = result {","                Logger.error(\"Backend sync failed: \\(error)\")","            }","        }","    }","}"],"syntax":"swift","type":"codeListing"}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","references":{"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration":{"title":"PWConfiguration","abstract":[],"url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"PWConfiguration","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration"},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore/PWConfiguration/registerForPushNotificationsWithCompletion:":{"title":"registerForPushNotificationsWithCompletion:","abstract":[{"text":"Registers the device for push notifications with a completion handler.","type":"text"}],"url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore\/pwconfiguration\/registerforpushnotificationswithcompletion:","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"+ ","kind":"text"},{"text":"registerForPushNotificationsWithCompletion:","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore\/documentation\/PushwooshCore\/PWConfiguration\/registerForPushNotificationsWithCompletion:","navigatorTitle":[{"kind":"identifier","text":"registerForPushNotificationsWithCompletion:"}]},"doc://com.pushwoosh.PushwooshCore/documentation/PushwooshCore":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Core foundation module for Pushwoosh SDK."}],"url":"\/documentation\/pushwooshcore","role":"collection","kind":"symbol","type":"topic","title":"PushwooshCore","identifier":"doc:\/\/com.pushwoos